---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Research">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Research themes</p><h1>Exploring intelligence<br />through <em>the body.</em></h1><p class="lead">Research in compliant mechanisms, manipulation, and dynamic robotic systems.</p></header>
  <section class="theme-list" aria-label="Research themes">
    <article><span class="theme-number">01</span><div><h2>Embodied Intelligence</h2><p>How can we embed intelligence into the structure and material of robots, and blend them with computational intelligence?</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/#compliant-mechanisms">Explore the experiment →</a></div><span class="theme-tag">Structure & deformation</span></article>
    <article><span class="theme-number">02</span><div><h2>Robot Manipulation</h2><p>How can robots deftly and safely interact with all the objects in our world?</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/#robotic-locomotion">Explore the experiment →</a></div><span class="theme-tag">Energy & movement</span></article>
    <article><span class="theme-number">03</span><div><h2>Ubiquitous Robots</h2><p>How will robots fit into our environment and live among us?</p></div><span class="theme-tag">Interaction</span></article>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
